# React Native Rules

- Use a shared design system approach for visual consistency.
- Keep API integration behind an abstraction layer.
- Prefer reusable components and hooks over duplicated screens logic.
- Build responsive/adaptive layouts for varied device sizes.
- Design for offline-ready behavior where product scope requires it.
